{
  "_comment": "GST tax invoices (CGST rule 46). Run by frontend/tests/sharedFixtures.test.ts (lib/gst.ts) and backend/tests/test_shared_fixtures.py (gst_service). Taxes: within a state CGST + SGST at half the rate each (UTGST in Union territories without a legislature), between states IGST; per line, taxable value = round(qty * unit price) - discount and each tax rounds half-up to the paisa.",
